Text Notes 787 9843 0    79   ~ 0
GPS_TX = PA2 (USART2 TX) -> GPS RX,  GPS_RX = GPS TX -> PA3.   FTDI pin4 = adapter TXO -> PA10 (USART1 RX).  EXP1 = PA1, EXP2 = PB15.
Text Notes 787 866 0    98   ~ 0
POWER: 3xAA -> TPS63001 buck-boost 3.3 V
Text Notes 787 4646 0    79   ~ 0
VBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2  ->  PA0 (ADC1_IN0, 3.3 V ref; 5.4 V max -> 2.7 V)
Text Notes 787 10315 0    79   ~ 0
Footprints from KiCad stock libs. RA-02 uses the Ra-01 SMD-16 footprint (same 17x16 mm, 2.0 mm pitch) - check against your module before ordering.
Text Notes 11811 866 0    98   ~ 0
RADIO: RA-02 SX1278 433 MHz
Text Notes 787 4409 0    79   ~ 0
Use lithium AA (Energizer L91) - alkaline cells lose most capacity below -20 C.
Text Notes 6496 5669 0    79   ~ 0
SWD on J10. Bootloader: jumper J10 pins 5-6, reset, use J4.
Text Notes 787 10079 0    79   ~ 0
Electronics are rated -40..+85 C (RA-02 -20..+70 C): fly the PCB + batteries in an insulated foam box; only the PT1000 probe outside.
Text Notes 787 6496 0    98   ~ 0
CONNECTORS: FTDI (USART1), GPS (USART2), expansion
Text Notes 787 4882 0    98   ~ 0
HEATER: 8 x 120R 0.25 W on VBAT_PROT, Q2 low side, PA8 thermostat
Text Notes 11811 3937 0    98   ~ 0
PRESSURE: MS5607 (I2C 0x77)
Text Notes 6496 866 0    98   ~ 0
MCU: STM32F103C8T6 on board (LQFP-48), 8 MHz crystal Y1
Text Notes 10630 6496 0    98   ~ 0
TEMPERATURE: MAX31865 + PT1000 4-wire
Text Notes 6496 5197 0    79   ~ 0
VDD and VBAT on +3V3, VDDA through FB1.
Text Notes 6496 5433 0    79   ~ 0
BOOT0 and PB2 pulled low by R11, R12. No USB.
$EndSCHEMATC
